First, you are given $N$, the number of employees, followed by $N$ employee records:
Each record has: `id name salary street city zip dept_name floor`.
Then, you are given $Q$, the number of queries to execute:
1. `CITY_COUNT <city>`: Print the number of employees whose `address.city` matches `<city>`.
